%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 56f76f92bdab4dd4b985e74d8d7f1201, type: 3}
  m_Name: CutsceneSequence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  cutscenes:
  - title: CutScene 1
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 633da36568dea0443bbf8bdb5a67032d, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - Long ago, there was a boy who believed in AI.
    - He studied day and night, hoping to use it to make the world better.
  - title: CutScene 2
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 35312809bf85fb84eb2f45fa180d304e, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - But as AI grew stronger, fear grew with it.
    - People blamed AI for everything they could not understand.
  - title: CutScene 3
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 917bc91126d7a204fa7041edb05510fa, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - Because he still supported AI, the boy became a target.
    - They mocked him, hunted him, and chased him away.
  - title: CutScene 4
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7794d543e3f952b4697e215cbb15a04c, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - Alone and broken, he made a promise with something evil.
    - If the world wanted a monster, he would become one.
    - He swore to serve the devils as their butcher.
  - title: CutScene 5
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 303be8cb63d450347a6d3758565eb049, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - And that is how the restaurant began.
    - Now he cooks for the things that live in the dark.
    - Welcome to Slice Suffer Serve!
  - title: CutScene 6
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: c7ccdb8582cf3a0408287bc4c8b36982, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - The restaurant became a place for those who lived in the dark.
    - Monsters, devils, and forgotten things came from everywhere to taste his food.
    - For the first time in years, the boy felt useful again.
    - The customers smiled, laughed, and praised his work.
  - title: CutScene 7
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6942b39fcac26bc4b80f68f1e3c0d6e0, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - The devil watched his work with great satisfaction.
    - "\u201CYou have served us well,\u201D the devil said."
    - "\u201CYour hands are no longer weak. They create hunger, fear, and joy.\u201D"
    - The room cheered for him, but the boy could not smile.
  - title: CutScene 8
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3fe7e1252e0a4a14d8eaa27878cc6d2e, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - But when the noise faded, silence returned.
    - The boy looked at his hands and wondered what he had become.
    - Was he finally accepted?
    - Or had he only become the monster they said he was?
  - title: CutScene 9
    background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 22a5782c09866ea42bc7be61c9051d88, type: 3}
    dialogueLines:
    - Far away, the humans heard rumors of the cursed restaurant.
    - They feared the butcher who fed the creatures of the dark.
    - A cruel man placed gold on the table and hired a hunter.
    - "\u201CBring me the boy,\u201D he said. \u201CDead or alive.\u201D"
